Domain Path 
	documentation 
" This domain defines the model that consists of information needed for tracking a student progress in achieving an educational goal.
* A PathMilestone entity captures the details about significant event and achievements in the path.
* A StudentPathMilestoneStatus entity is to define student's place in those significant progress marks. 
* A PathPhase entity is to identify the stages of becoming an educator.
* A StudentPathPhaseStatus entity is to define student's place in those stages of the path."
	domain entity Path
	domain entity PathMilestone
	domain entity PathPhase
	domain entity StudentPath
	domain entity StudentPathMilestoneStatus
	domain entity StudentPathPhaseStatus